{"id":"n62242-2-7","stage":1,"title":"기르다 · 养","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62242-2-7-1","ko":"어미야, 애들 키우기 힘들지?","zh":"孩子妈妈，养孩子很辛苦吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어미야,","meaning":"孩子妈，孩子他妈","explanation":"어미：孩子妈，孩子他妈；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"어미","audio":"/audio/97a9bd7bec4cc752a5b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71194","senseId":"3","lemma":"어미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어미야","audio":"/audio/00cd7f38f89073bc4480.mp3"}},{"text":"애들","meaning":"孩子，小孩","explanation":"애：孩子，小孩；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"1","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"애들","audio":"/audio/b4ef5e113942e7f176cd.mp3"}},{"text":"키우기","meaning":"养","explanation":"키우다：养；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"키우다","audio":"/audio/cff5458b4f7fee672311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66587","senseId":"2","lemma":"키우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"키우기","audio":"/audio/7f04d14be2e0427b33a7.mp3"}},{"text":"힘들지?","meaning":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","explanation":"힘들다：累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘들지","audio":"/audio/b3d57a7eddab4c9b3faf.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"97a9bd7bec4cc752","term":"어미","zh":"孩子妈，孩子他妈","audio":"/audio/97a9bd7bec4cc752a5b4.mp3","entryId":"71194","definition":"父母用于指称结婚后已有子女的女儿。","pronunciation":["어미"]},{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子，小孩","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"cff5458b4f7fee67","term":"키우다","zh":"养","audio":"/audio/cff5458b4f7fee672311.mp3","entryId":"66587","definition":"照料动植物而使其成长。","pronunciation":["키우다"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"有花费很多力气的一面。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7f5e51ef99ddbc179a0c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62242-2-7-2","ko":"자식을 길러 보니 부모님 마음을 알겠어요.","zh":"自己养了孩子，才明白父母的心情。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자식을","meaning":"子女","explanation":"자식：子女；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자식","audio":"/audio/b642f4b4b990f8387501.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49308","senseId":"1","lemma":"자식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자식을","audio":"/audio/6d9014eae40c1b7d6670.mp3"}},{"text":"길러","meaning":"养，养育，抚育","explanation":"기르다：养，养育，抚育；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"기르다","audio":"/audio/8b121394eb596253aeec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62242","senseId":"2","lemma":"기르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길러","audio":"/audio/c975374a4bb195fc6729.mp3"}},{"text":"보니","meaning":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보니","audio":"/audio/50ecd95f90550aea6361.mp3"}},{"text":"부모님","meaning":"父母","explanation":"부모님：父母","readings":[{"term":"부모님","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62272","senseId":"1","lemma":"부모님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부모님","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3"}},{"text":"마음을","meaning":"心情，心绪","explanation":"마음：心情，心绪；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"3","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마음을","audio":"/audio/b0b3c273455e1de5d694.mp3"}},{"text":"알겠어요.","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알겠어요","audio":"/audio/3af262f285badbf60003.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b642f4b4b990f838","term":"자식","zh":"子女","audio":"/audio/b642f4b4b990f8387501.mp3","entryId":"49308","definition":"儿子和女儿，或单指儿子或女儿。","pronunciation":["자식"]},{"id":"8b121394eb596253","term":"기르다","zh":"养，养育，抚育","audio":"/audio/8b121394eb596253aeec.mp3","entryId":"62242","definition":"抚养孩子。","pronunciation":["기르다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"068bccdcf866defe","term":"부모님","zh":"父母","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3","entryId":"62272","definition":"(敬语)父亲和母亲。","pronunciation":["부모님"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心情，心绪","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3","entryId":"20911","definition":"情绪或感受。","pronunciation":["마음"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/10386c596a1e8bc11665.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.69,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62242","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":49,"sequenceScore":2.1407,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["自己养了孩子，才明白父母的心情。","这是哪个国家的语言啊？","孩子妈妈，养孩子很辛苦吧？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["自己养了孩子，才明白父母的心情。","孩子妈妈，养孩子很辛苦吧？","这是哪个国家的语言啊？"],"answer":0}]}
